{"author": null, "category": "instagram", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["instagram-posts-2026-06-14-olga-its-all-just-a-md-cec6cad2da:u000001"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "belief", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "Olga … It’s all just a game But there is no Winner or a Loser Just a Player and NPC NPC - stands for non-playable character. He has no choice - no freedom.", "unit_id": "instagram-posts-2026-06-14-olga-its-all-just-a-md-cec6cad2da:u000001"}], "text": "Olga believes that life can be seen as just a game with no winner or loser, only players and non-playable characters (NPCs)."}, "title": "Game Metaphor", "topic": "game_life_metaphor"}, "content_hash": "4ff5333d903c1e6b0f63e67f3b0b7cd98e6a8a9ad2accd129c7f12495023e102", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "instagram-posts-2026-06-14-olga-its-all-just-a-md-cec6cad2da:knowledge:4b26f5149472dc39", "metadata_hash": "b7365ee1e913d1e342265580da23667e1029329c7110047756ffe38cfd5e549d", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-06-14T16:36:21Z", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "post", "source_hash": "cdac2e4d5576133263c048fa58687d3b5ef37f7db64036f45e849bb9f00067ef", "source_id": "instagram-posts-2026-06-14-olga-its-all-just-a-md-cec6cad2da", "source_url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DZkr9kAAnBx/", "title": "Game Metaphor", "topic": "game_life_metaphor", "topic_slug": "game_life_metaphor"}
{"author": null, "category": "instagram", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["instagram-posts-2026-06-14-olga-its-all-just-a-md-cec6cad2da:u000001"], "exceptions": [], "goal": {"citations": [{"quote": "Being a Player - is all the purpose of living the Game.", "unit_id": "instagram-posts-2026-06-14-olga-its-all-just-a-md-cec6cad2da:u000001"}], "text": "To start living life as a game player rather than an NPC."}, "kind": "method", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [{"citations": [{"quote": "And to Start your Game Now - just ask yourself- “Interesting if I have not had these limitations - what would I do next?”", "unit_id": "instagram-posts-2026-06-14-olga-its-all-just-a-md-cec6cad2da:u000001"}], "text": "Ask yourself what you would do if you did not have your current limitations."}], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "Being a Player - is all the purpose of living the Game. And to Start your Game Now - just ask yourself- “Interesting if I have not had these limitations - what would I do next?”", "unit_id": "instagram-posts-2026-06-14-olga-its-all-just-a-md-cec6cad2da:u000001"}], "text": "To start living life as a player, one should question what they would do without their current limitations."}, "title": "Becoming a Player", "topic": "game_life_metaphor"}, "content_hash": "4ff5333d903c1e6b0f63e67f3b0b7cd98e6a8a9ad2accd129c7f12495023e102", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "instagram-posts-2026-06-14-olga-its-all-just-a-md-cec6cad2da:knowledge:2a40263ca5f86ab7", "metadata_hash": "b7365ee1e913d1e342265580da23667e1029329c7110047756ffe38cfd5e549d", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-06-14T16:36:21Z", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "post", "source_hash": "cdac2e4d5576133263c048fa58687d3b5ef37f7db64036f45e849bb9f00067ef", "source_id": "instagram-posts-2026-06-14-olga-its-all-just-a-md-cec6cad2da", "source_url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DZkr9kAAnBx/", "title": "Becoming a Player", "topic": "game_life_metaphor", "topic_slug": "game_life_metaphor"}
{"author": null, "category": "instagram", "content": {"context_unit_ids": ["instagram-posts-2026-06-14-olga-its-all-just-a-md-cec6cad2da:u000001"], "form": "structure", "observation": {"citations": [{"quote": "Olga … It’s all just a game But there is no Winner or a Loser Just a Player and NPC NPC - stands for non-playable character. He has no choice - no freedom. Being a Player - is all the purpose of living the Game. And to Start your Game Now - just ask yourself- “Interesting if I have not had these limitations - what would I do next?”", "unit_id": "instagram-posts-2026-06-14-olga-its-all-just-a-md-cec6cad2da:u000001"}], "text": "The text presents the idea that life is a game, distinguishing between 'players' and 'NPCs', and how to transition from one role to another by questioning limitations."}, "purpose": null, "speaker_id": null, "title": "Game Metaphor Structure", "topic": "game_life_metaphor"}, "content_hash": "4ff5333d903c1e6b0f63e67f3b0b7cd98e6a8a9ad2accd129c7f12495023e102", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "instagram-posts-2026-06-14-olga-its-all-just-a-md-cec6cad2da:expression:8447cebaecdd5c44", "metadata_hash": "b7365ee1e913d1e342265580da23667e1029329c7110047756ffe38cfd5e549d", "product": "expression", "published_at": "2026-06-14T16:36:21Z", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "post", "source_hash": "cdac2e4d5576133263c048fa58687d3b5ef37f7db64036f45e849bb9f00067ef", "source_id": "instagram-posts-2026-06-14-olga-its-all-just-a-md-cec6cad2da", "source_url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DZkr9kAAnBx/", "title": "Game Metaphor Structure", "topic": "game_life_metaphor", "topic_slug": "game_life_metaphor"}
